{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>The first of the first-fruits of your land.</b> The choicest of the first-fruits, as in וְרֵאשִׁית שְׁמָנִים יִמְשָׁחוּ נְקוּבֵי רֵאשִׁית הַגּוֹיִם (Amos 6:6) — these being the first-fruits of the seven species, according to what is received in tradition." "<b>You shall not cook a kid in its mother's milk.</b> Do not perform such practices to increase the fruits, as idolaters conceive — rather, <b>the first of the first-fruits of your land you shall bring</b>, as it says: וְרֵאשִׁית כָּל בִּכּוּרֵי כֹל, וְכָל תְּרוּמַת כֹל וְגוֹ', לְהַנִּיחַ בְּרָכָה אֶל בֵּיתֶךָ (Ezekiel 44:30)."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:26:59.760334511Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}